--[[
	Player Tweaks Panel  (compact / tabbed)
	---------------------------------------
	A LocalScript with a small draggable GUI split into three tabs:

		MOVE    WalkSpeed, Jump, Field of View, Noclip
		VIEW    Fullbright, ESP on other players
		KEY     Object ESP (find "redkey" and friends) + scan rate

	WHERE TO PUT IT:
		StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts   (recommended)
		or StarterGui (as a LocalScript inside a ScreenGui)

	HOTKEYS:
		RightShift  show / hide panel      N  noclip
		B  fullbright                      V  player ESP
		K  key ESP                         [ ]  narrow / wide FOV

	Works on PC and mobile. Settings survive respawn.
--]]

